  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project works to strengthen capacity of the three organizations on service delivery for the LGBTIQ+ community in India, Nepal and Banlgadesh. The services are within mental health counselling, LGBTIQ+ curriculum development and availability, and corporate sector workplacements. The project&apos;s target group is young people between 18-35.  India, Nepal and Banlgadesh</narrative>
  </description>
